# The JST Macrohistory dataset is free but licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (attribution,
# non-commercial, share-alike). It is freely re-downloadable by anyone from
# macrohistory.net, so — to keep the repo free of share-alike entanglement — the
# raw file is git-ignored and only the reduced, attributed aggregates ship.
# (Flip this if you'd rather commit the raw file; CC BY-NC-SA permits it for
# non-commercial use with attribution.)
*.dta
*.xlsx
*.csv
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.manifest.json
